vCU Get Pod Info
    [Documentation]  This keyword is used to get vcu pod information.
    ...  It supports multi gnbs in one testline.
    ...  Connect to vcu cluster via tenant user
    ...
    ...    |    Input Parameters     | Man. | Description |
    ...    |   gnb_index             | No |  gnb index in testline configurtion file. Default is 0. |
    ...    |   conn_prompt           | No |  connection prompt, default is ${empty}. |
    ...    |   pod _abbr             | No   | the abbreviation of pod name, such as upue.             |
    ...    *RETURN VALUE*
    ...   vcu_pod_container_mapping， {[pod_name: container_1, container_2,...]}
    ...
    [Arguments]  ${gnb_index}=0   ${conn_prompt}=${EMPTY}   ${pod_abbr}=all
    ${alias}    generic_utils.get_unique_id_string
    ${namespace}   tl_config.get_vcu_namespace
    ...  gnb_index=${gnb_index}
    ssh_conn.connect_to_vcu_cloud_hosting
    ...  using_tenant=${True}
    ...  prompt=${conn_prompt}
    ...  gnb_index=${gnb_index}
    ...  alias=${alias}
    ${vcu_pod_info}   run keyword if  '${pod_abbr}'=='all'   vcu_cli_base.get_vcu_pods_info   namespace=${namespace}   alias=${alias}
    ...  ELSE    vcu_cli_base.get_vcu_specific_pods_info    pod_abbr=${pod_abbr}   alias=${alias}
    [return]    ${vcu_pod_info}
    [Teardown]    ssh_conn.disconnect_vcu_cloud_hosting  alias=${alias}


