vCU Get Pod And Container Full Name
    [Arguments]  ${pod_abbr}   ${ctr_abbr}=${None}    ${gnb_index}=0   ${conn_prompt}=${EMPTY}
    [Documentation]    This keyword is used to get the full name of pod and container in vCU.
    ...  If there are multiple pods of a certain type like upue, pod_abbr should be upue-<index> like upue-0 to specify which pod to choose.
    ...  If multi upue existed in OE and pod_abbr is upue, it will return a random upue full name.
    ...  If multi container of one certain type are found in one pod like l2hicu in upue,
    ...  ctr_abbr should be l2hicu-<index> like l2hicu-0 to specify which container to choose.
    ...  If ctr_abbr is l2hicu(no index), it will return a random l2hicu full name.
    ...
    ...    |    Input Parameters     | Man. | Description |
    ...    |   pod_abbr              | YES  | the abbreviation of pod name, such as cpif.             |
    ...    |   ctr_abbr             | YES  | the abbreviation of container name, such as cpif. Default is None.     |
    ...    |   gnb_index             | NO   |  gnb index in testline configurtion file. Default is 0. |
    ...    |   conn_prompt           | NO   |  connection prompt, default is ${EMPTY}.                |
    ...    *RETURN VALUE*
    ...
    ...    the full name of pod and container
    ...
    ${alias}    generic_utils.get_unique_id_string
    ${namespace}   tl_config.get_vcu_namespace
    ...  gnb_index=${gnb_index}
    ssh_conn.connect_to_vcu_cloud_hosting
    ...  using_tenant=${True}
    ...  prompt=${conn_prompt}
    ...  gnb_index=${gnb_index}
    ...  alias=${alias}

    ${full_pod_name}  ${full_container_name}  ssh_conn.get_full_pod_and_container_name
    ...  pod_abbr=${pod_abbr}
    ...  namespace=${namespace}
    ...  container_abbr=${ctr_abbr}
    ...  alias=${alias}
    [Return]  ${full_pod_name}   ${full_container_name}
    [Teardown]    ssh_conn.disconnect_vcu_cloud_hosting  alias=${alias}

