VCU Check CMP Secert Pod Deleted After Deployed
    [Arguments]   ${secret_name}   ${conn_prompt}=${EMPTY}   ${gnb_index}=0
    [Documentation]  VCU Check CMP Secert Pod Deleted After Deployed
    ...    *Author:* rui.3.li@nokia-sbell.com
    ...    *Change History*
    ...    | date | who | waht or how |
    ...    | 2023-10-13 | r3li | add keyword |
    ...    *Arguments Description*
    ...    | Input Parameters | Man. | Description |
    ...    | secret_name | Yes | secret name |
    ...    | conn_prompt | No | The prompt of ssh connection to OE. |
    ...    | gnb_index | No | int, gnb index. |
    ...    *Example*
    ...    | VCU Check CMP Secert Pod Deleted After Deployed | testscret | 0 |
    ...    *Return*
    ...
    ${alias}    generic_utils.get_unique_id_string
    ${ns}   tl_config.get_vcu_namespace
    ...  gnb_index=${gnb_index}
    ssh_conn.connect_to_vcu_cloud_hosting
    ...  using_tenant=${True}
    ...  prompt=${conn_prompt}
    ...  gnb_index=${gnb_index}
    ...  alias=${alias}
    ${result}   ssh_conn.execute_normal_cmd
    ...  base_command=kubectl get secret
    ...  namespace=${ns}
    ...  pipe_cmd=| grep ${secret_name} | awk '{print $1}'
    ...  alias=${alias}
    Run Keyword If   '${secret_name}' in '${result}'   Fail   CMP Secert Pod Not Deleted After Deployed
    [Teardown]   ssh_conn.disconnect_vcu_cloud_hosting   alias=${alias}
